    {"id":"yigezijue","label":"一个字，绝！","require_all":["exceptional_skill","successful_outcome"],"require_any":["precise_placement","difficult_save","creative_finish","solo_block"],"forbid":["routine_action","outcome_uncertain"],"placements":["after_action"],"min_confidence":0.92,"condition":"落点、技巧或救球处理特别漂亮，完整结果已经出现之后。","avoid":"普通击球、结果未出现，或长台词挤掉下一次触球。"},
